<title>PHILIPPINES: Swift buys 10,000 T Chinese yellow corn.</title>
<headline>Swift buys 10,000 T Chinese yellow corn.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swift Foods Inc bought 10,000 tonnes of Chinese yellow corn at $138 per tonne C&amp;F, an official of the company told Reuters on Monday.  </p>
<p>Swift bought the corn for July arrival through trading firm Louis Dreyfus Corporation, said Edward Acosta, vice president for the feeds division at Swift.</p>
<p>The deal to buy the corn was made last week, he added.</p>
<p>&quot;At $138 per tonne C&amp;F, the landed cost of the imported corn is cheaper at 7.14 pesos per kg as against the current domestic wholesale price of 10 pesos,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
